  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Leap motion currently has an sdk that can be easily integrated into unity, and I myself would say that leg tracking is too expensive and not as useful anyways. Finger tracking would allow for so much more expression and without the cost of needing more room space for a kinect alternative. Here is to hoping this is considered, I really want this to be a thing for VRChat. Its a very interesting add on for sure.",
